","The carved boulder is 6.80 m x 3.20 m with a depth of 0.85 m (Khyber Pakhtunkhwa DOAM record 4672); the carved face is read as the 6.80 m height by the 3.20 m width, which the record does not state.","The rock mass behind the panel and the surrounding outcrop are estimated from the photos.","The seated figure, its halo, shoulders, crossed legs and hands are estimated raised geometry (about 3.1 m wide, 4.9 m high to the halo top); the photos show a figure of similar proportion, with the face weathered.","The DOAM record gives 34.69915 N, 72.26303 E for the same carving ('Ghaligai-I'), about 0.8 km from the OSM node; the photos and the road position match the OSM node, so the node is used.","The terrace is 0 (the rock face is not levelled); the figure stands on the real slope about 1.2 m above the ground, estimated from the photos.","Season colours, snow, ice and dawn mist are illustrative.","Traffic on the drive is illustrative: the vehicle kinds are those seen on Swat roads (Willys jeeps, Hilux, Suzuki vans, Mehran cars, CD70 motorbikes, Qingqi rickshaws, painted trucks); their number and movement are not counted."],"sources":[{"name":"Copernicus DEM GLO-30","use":"terrain heights","licence":"© DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA","url":"https://spacedata.copernicus.eu/collections/copernicus-digital-elevation-model"},{"name":"ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200","use":"trees, meadow, rock, snow","licence":"CC BY 4.0, © ESA WorldCover project 2021","url":"https://esa-worldcover.org"},{"name":"Khyber Pakhtunkhwa DOAM site record 4672 (Ghaligai-I, Buddhist rock carvings, Swat)","use":"boulder size 6.80 m x 3.20 m, depth 0.85 m, date 7th-8th century CE, dhyani mudra, slight erosion","licence":"Government of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa record; facts only, no image used","url":"https://doam.gov.pk/public/sites/4672"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap","use":"the N-95 trunk road from Barikot to Mingora (the last 0.6 km before the rock), and the OSM tourism node 'Buddah' at the rock","licence":"ODbL, © OpenStreetMap contributors","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"}]}